From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: minimal <noreply@minimal.dev>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 17:11:11 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(command): limit how long spawn waits for the container
 setup

Add Command::setup_timeout. spawn waits for the supervisor to set up the
container, and a mount whose source does not answer keeps it there with
no end. With a timeout the supervisor is killed when the limit passes,
and the child's exit status names the timeout.
